  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Legal Assistance Consortium (ILAC) st&#xf6;djer l&#xe4;nders r&#xe4;ttsystem, med fokus p&#xe5; l&#xe4;nder som nyligen varit i eller riskerar v&#xe5;ldsam konflikt. Sida ger ILAC ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r arbetet med att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra r&#xe4;ttssytem, tex utbildning av domare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Legal Assistance Consortium (ILAC) supports the system of rule of law in countries, with a focus on countries affected by or at risk of violent conflict. Sida supports ILAC with a core support to improve justice systems, for instance the training of judges.</narrative>
